; THE RITUAL'S SLOWED (ruling 19), Catalytic Hammer's shape (mw_catalytic_hammer.tres): ON_HIT
; (apply_on 1), which a crit also reaches; a save to avoid, SYSTEMS (save_type 2, Lancer.HASE.SYS),
; forced by the bow's SpecificAction; Slowed at its standard END_OF_NEXT_TURN (status_slowed.tres).
; Carried only by buff_ritual_of_the_first_god, never by the bow itself.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_onhit")
apply_on = 1
statuses = Array[StringName]([&"slowed"])
save_to_avoid = true
save_type = 2
